{
 "id": "story-rabbit-turtle",
 "type": "story",
 "source": "Aesop's fable, retold in simple Korean for this site.",
 "items": [
  {
   "text": "토끼와 거북이가 달리기 시합을 했어요.",
   "roman": "tokkiwa geobugiga dalligi sihabeul haesseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "A rabbit and a turtle had a race."
   },
   "image": "🐇🏁🐢"
  },
  {
   "text": "토끼는 아주 빨랐어요.",
   "roman": "tokkineun aju ppallasseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The rabbit was very fast."
   },
   "image": "🐇💨"
  },
  {
   "text": "거북이는 아주 느렸어요.",
   "roman": "geobugineun aju neuryeosseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The turtle was very slow."
   },
   "image": "🐢🐌"
  },
  {
   "text": "토끼가 생각했어요. \"조금 자도 괜찮아.\"",
   "roman": "tokkiga saenggakaesseoyo. \"jogeum jado gwaenchana.\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The rabbit thought, \"It's fine if I sleep a little.\""
   },
   "image": "🐇💭"
  },
  {
   "text": "토끼는 나무 아래에서 잠을 잤어요.",
   "roman": "tokkineun namu araeeseo jameul jasseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The rabbit slept under a tree."
   },
   "image": "🌳😴🐇"
  },
  {
   "text": "거북이는 쉬지 않고 걸었어요.",
   "roman": "geobugineun swiji anko georeosseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The turtle kept walking without resting."
   },
   "image": "🐢🚶"
  },
  {
   "text": "토끼가 일어났을 때, 거북이는 벌써 도착했어요.",
   "roman": "tokkiga ireonasseul ttae, geobugineun beolsseo dochakaesseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "When the rabbit woke up, the turtle had already arrived."
   },
   "image": "🐇😲🏁🐢"
  },
  {
   "text": "천천히 가도 포기하지 않으면 이길 수 있어요.",
   "roman": "cheoncheonhi gado pogihaji aneumyeon igil su isseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "Even if you go slowly, you can win if you don't give up."
   },
   "image": "🏆"
  }
 ],
